uirements. A custom network topology is created in our project and by using a centralized SDN controller, the network is controlled. After programming the network in tune with our application, packets are generated to test different applications that we developed on the SDN. This project demonstrates the different capabilities of SDN, by implementing 3 major network applications- SDN switch as a hub, SDN switch as a Firewall, and Selective Routing using SDN.","topics":[],"score":219485,"global_rank":204805},{"name":"jbeda/tgik-test","owner":"jbeda","html_url":"https://github.com/jbeda/tgik-test","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219483,"global_rank":204810},{"name":"sphw/searu","owner":"sphw","html_url":"https://github.com/sphw/searu","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Rust","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219483,"global_rank":204814},{"name":"aimeefullerton/SnoIBM","owner":"aimeefullerton","html_url":"https://github.com/aimeefullerton/SnoIBM","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219483,"global_rank":204821},{"name":"diamondburned/matrixemopicker","owner":"diamondburned","html_url":"https://github.com/diamondburned/matrixemopicker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":"GTK Emoji Picker for Matrix that copies HTML","topics":[],"score":219483,"global_rank":204822},{"name":"FredHutch/mal068_071_paper","owner":"FredHutch","html_url":"https://github.com/FredHutch/mal068_071_paper","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":"Analysis code for the paper \"Comprehensive data integration approach to assess immune responses and correlates of RTS,S/AS01-mediated protection from malaria infection in controlled human malaria infection trials\"","topics":[],"score":219483,"global_rank":204824},{"name":"leahjia/llama2","owner":"leahjia","html_url":"https://github.